,"body":"While using Godot's build profile system to create a minimal custom build, discovered that adding `Mutex` to the list of disabled classes causes compilation errors as this:\r\n<img width=\"692\" height=\"237\" alt=\"图片\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/32895540-cecd-42ba-bf05-dcfe4eb8cb8b\" />\r\n\r\nConsidering that the `Mutex` class may be added by the `detect from project` behavior to the `disabled_classes` list of the ` build_profile`, which could potentially lead to the aforementioned issues when using this feature, adding it to the `hardcoded_classes` collection should be the correct solution\r\n\r\n- *Bugsquad edit: This partially addresses https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115232.*","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2909900850,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTA5OTAwODUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:export","name":"topic:export","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-11-21T08:12:34Z",